# Split installer parts are opaque binaries: never diff, never count as source.
*.exe.[0-9][0-9][0-9] binary linguist-vendored
*.tar.gz.[0-9][0-9][0-9] binary linguist-vendored
*.blockmap binary linguist-vendored

# Everything that runs on Linux must stay LF even in a Windows checkout with autocrlf=true
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
